      "data": {
        "text": "**Selecting Transcription Provider**\n\nI've decided to move forward with the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API. It seems like a solid, widely-used option for the `submit_transcription.py` script. The next step is to begin writing the code and setting up the API key.\n\n\n**Defining Implementation Steps**\n\nI'm solidifying the implementation steps for `submit_transcription.py`. I'll first create the script, then integrate Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API. It will include provider-specific signals for clarity, such as the `google.cloud.speech_v1p1beta1` identifier, and the client library. The next step is to begin writing the code itself.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789819124635,
          "start": 1789819122090
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b98871aa0014K6qCmkbawkJm4",
      "message_id": "msg_0b9886c5c001WWQkiO41z2Ywm2",
